      <marc:subfield code="a">Once I had four brothers. Three of them are dead. I am next. Felix Ashe is sure of only one thing. In thirty days, on his eighteenth birthday, he will die. The gruesome deaths of his three brothers have convinced Felix that he and his family are under a curse -- one doomed to stop anyone inheriting his family&apos;s incredible fortune. When an opportunity to break the curse appears to present itself, it&apos;s impossible not to heed its dark call. And bound to everything is a deadly secret society who will either be Felix&apos;s downfall... or his one chance at redemption.</marc:subfield>
